@startuml sd_us113
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US113 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "RouteController" as RouteController
participant "ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase" as ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase
participant "ViewRouteDetailsUseCase" as ViewRouteDetailsUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
== GET /api/routes/airport/{iataCode} ==
Actor -> EAR : GET /api/routes/airport/{iataCode}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> RouteController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
RouteController -> ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase : execute(...)
ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase -> DBAR : own routes
ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase -> PAR : GET /internal/replicas/routes\n(every peer in parallel)
PAR --> ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase : their routes
ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase -> DBAR : airports (catalog, complete here)
ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase -> ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase : keep the latest change of each record,\nleave out deleted ones; filter, compute, sort, page
ListRoutesFromAirportUseCase --> RouteController : result
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id; X-Partial-Result if both holders of a record were unreachable)
== GET /api/routes/{origin}/{destination} ==
Actor -> EAR : GET /api/routes/{origin}/{destination}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> RouteController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
RouteController -> ViewRouteDetailsUseCase : execute(...)
ViewRouteDetailsUseCase -> DBAR : find route
alt held by this replica
DBAR --> ViewRouteDetailsUseCase : route
ViewRouteDetailsUseCase --> RouteController : result
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id)
else not held here (NotFoundException)
DBAR --> ViewRouteDetailsUseCase : nothing
ViewRouteDetailsUseCase --> RouteController : NotFoundException
RouteController -> PAR : same GET, X-Peer-Forwarded\n(every peer in parallel; 0.5 s to connect, 2 s to answer, one retry, circuit breaker)
PAR --> RouteController : 200 from the first peer that holds it
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id, X-Data-Node)
note over RouteController, PAR : 404 only if every peer answered without it;\n503 with Retry-After if a peer could not be asked
end
@enduml
